---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Network from '../components/Network.astro';
import NextBand from '../components/NextBand.astro';
---
<Base title="Ripples | One useful interaction creates another" description="Ripples connects interesting people, better questions and useful ideas through what people can give, learn and ask.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div><p class="section-label">A network where the currency is usefulness</p><h1>One useful interaction <em>creates another.</em></h1><p class="lede">Ripples brings people, questions and ideas together around a simple premise: lead with what you can give, stay curious and make the next interaction count.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/join/">Join the Ripple</a><a class="text-link" href="/about/">What is Ripples? <span>→</span></a></div></div>
    <Network/>
    <a class="scroll-cue" href="#questions"><span>Keep exploring</span><b aria-hidden="true">↓</b></a>
  </section>
  <section class="questions" id="questions">
    <div><p class="section-label">A different starting point</p><h2>What if we stopped asking people <em>what they do?</em></h2><p>A job title is useful context. It is rarely the most interesting thing about someone.</p></div>
    <ul><li>How can you help?</li><li>What are you curious about?</li><li>What could you use help with?</li></ul>
  </section>
  <section class="pathways" aria-labelledby="pathways-title">
    <div class="section-head"><p class="section-label">Three ways in</p><h2 id="pathways-title">Follow the person, the thought or the conversation.</h2></div>
    <div class="path-grid">
      <a class="path-card people-path" href="/people/"><span class="rings one" aria-hidden="true"></span><h3>People</h3><p>Meet people through what they can share, what they are learning and what help would matter.</p><b>Meet the people →</b></a>
      <a class="path-card ideas-path" href="/ideas/"><span class="rings two" aria-hidden="true"></span><h3>Ideas</h3><p>Better questions, useful disagreements and things worth learning, crediting and passing on.</p><b>Explore ideas →</b></a>
      <a class="path-card conversations-path" href="/podcast/"><span class="rings three-rings" aria-hidden="true"></span><h3>Conversations</h3><p>Longer conversations about how people think, what shaped them and what changed their minds.</p><b>Explore conversations →</b></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="question"><p class="section-label">Put your hand up</p><blockquote>“What can you genuinely help someone with?”</blockquote><p>You do not need a grand title or a polished pitch. You need something useful you are prepared to share.</p><a class="button light" href="/join/">Tell us how you can help</a></section>
  <section class="loop"><div><p class="section-label">How Ripples grows</p><h2>People create the network.<br/><em>Useful interactions move it.</em></h2></div><ol><li><span>01</span><b>Offer</b><p>Share what you can genuinely help with.</p></li><li><span>02</span><b>Connect</b><p>Find a question, person or idea worth your attention.</p></li><li><span>03</span><b>Pass it on</b><p>Let one useful interaction create the next.</p></li></ol></section>
  <section class="foundation"><div><p class="section-label">The foundation</p><ul><li>Help because you can.</li><li>Make the next interaction count.</li><li>Act with integrity.</li><li>Trust the ripples.</li></ul></div><aside class="founder-card"><img src="/images/people/ben-khodeir.jpg" alt="Ben Khodeir"/><div><p class="section-label">Started and curated by</p><h3>Ben Khodeir</h3><p>Ben created Ripples to follow curiosity, make useful connections and pass on what is worth sharing.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Why Ripples exists →</a></div></aside></section>
  <NextBand eyebrow="The next ripple" title="Meet the people already here." body="Start with what they can help with, what they are curious about and what they are trying to learn." href="/people/" link="Explore People"/>
</Base>
